OL,3,GNEWSANHS Grampian stands down critical
OL,4,Aincident after 'extreme pressure'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Grampian has stood down a
OL,7,Fboard-level "critical incident" which
OL,8,Fwas declared at emergency departments
OL,9,Fin Aberdeen and Elgin.
OL,11,FIt was put in place on Saturday night,
OL,12,Fwith A&Es at both Aberdeen Royal
OL,13,FInfirmary (ARI) and Dr Gray's Hospital
OL,14,Fboth experiencing "extreme pressure".
OL,16,FNHS Grampian said it would retain a
OL,17,Fhospital-level critical incident status
OL,18,Ffor Dr Gray's in Elgin.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
